! 4일치를 날려서 2-7부터 다시 하기로... 
! Save the PT file every hour!
! Save separate PT file when each part is done.
! 
!
! ===== Part 2-7: Access Ports =====
!
! ======= ASW-A1 =======
! F0/1 to LWAP1
int f0/1
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 99
switchport nonegotiate
!
!
! ======= ASW-A2 =======
! F0/1 to PCs & Phone1
int f0/1
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 10
switchport voice vlan 20
switchport nonegotiate
!
!
! ======= ASW-A3 =======
! F0/1 to PCs & Phone2
int f0/1
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 10
switchport voice vlan 20
switchport nonegotiate
!
!
! ======= ASW-B1 =======
! F0/1 to LWAP2
int f0/1
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 99
switchport nonegotiate
!
!
! ======= ASW-B2 =======
! F0/1 to PCs & Phone3
int f0/1
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 10
switchport voice vlan 20
switchport nonegotiate
!
!
! ======= ASW-B3 =======
! F0/1 to SRV1
int f0/1
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 30
switchport nonegotiate
!
!
! ===== Part 2-8: ASW-A1 to WLC1 =====
!
! F0/2 to WLC1
int f0/2
switchport mode trunk
switchport trunk allowed vlan 40,99
switchport trunk native vlan 99
switchport nonegotiate
!
!
! ===== Part 2-9: Disable unused ports =====
!
! ======= ASW-A1 =======
! F0/3 to F0/24
int range f0/3 - 24
shutdown
!
!
! ======= ASW-A2 to ASW-B3 =======
! F0/2 to F0/24
int range f0/2 - 24
shutdown
!
!
! ===== DSW-A1 to DSW-B2 =====
! g1/0/6 to 24 and 1/1/3 to 1/1/4
int range g1/0/6 - 24, g1/1/3 - 4
shutdown